      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JIMARY PROMISE (1) resumed from a break finishing eighth (17.82) at this track in a Mix 2/3. Solid record here including 14 wins. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. KINGSBRAE NOLA (4) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish second, beaten half a length (23.67) at this track in a Grade 5 over 411m. Leading chance. LARA DUTTON (7) has had a break of nine weeks since finishing third (17.40) over 300m at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Will go close here with a clear run. GOLDSTAR MILA (2) picked up a cheque last time and is in the mix again.",
